# grey-mech-adapter-gnosis — the Olas Mech Marketplace (Gnosis) as a ChannelIngress
# (BION-DIRECTIVE-101 §3). Entirely separate process/unit from grey-mech-adapter.service (Base) —
# own EnvironmentFile, own MECH_ADAPTER_OBSERVE_ONLY value — specifically so flipping payment
# acceptance on for Gnosis can never touch Base's own live, currently-revenue-generating flag
# (D-100 §1.3's finding: the flag was a single global value on one process; this is the fix,
# not a chain-scoping flag on the same process).
#
# WorkingDirectory pointed at a SEPARATE, ISOLATED checkout (/opt/grey/grey-gnosis-staging) from
# D-106 §2 through PR #54's merge (BION-DIRECTIVE-123, 2026-08-22): this unit's code (D-97/98/100/
# 101/103/104's chain-parameterization) lived only on the then-unmerged, held PR #54 — checking
# that branch out in the shared checkout would have put Base's live grey-mech-adapter.service one
# restart away from running unreviewed code. Now that PR #54 (plus #56/#57) is merged into main,
# repointed at the shared /opt/grey/grey checkout all other grey-* units build from, same as
# D-106 §2 always said this would do once merge happened. The staging checkout's job is done.
#
# Real mech/multisig now exist (BION-DIRECTIVE-105 §0: service 3789 Deployed) — this unit is
# genuinely installable now, unlike when this file was first authored (D-101, before registration
# completed). CORRECTED (BION-DIRECTIVE-111/112, 2026-08-21): D-105's mech
# (0x1a235555E9545F2B4F1A8e929317FFb893C94dDb, GNOSIS_MECH_ADDRESS_ORIGINAL_INERT in config.ts) was
# found permanently unpayable (D-109) and superseded by a corrected mech, GNOSIS_MECH_ADDRESS in
# config.ts (0xf482B2Abbd0230b960320096B7b132fABc66830b) — this unit's own real MECH_ADDRESS value
# lives in the EnvironmentFile below, not in this file; see config.ts for which address is current.
#
# Ships INSTALLED-BUT-DISABLED, same as the Base unit did originally. Enabling/starting it, and
# flipping its own MECH_ADAPTER_OBSERVE_ONLY to false, are separate, later, explicit Forces acts —
# same split D-100 §1.3 already specified, unchanged by this directive.
[Unit]
Description=Grey mech adapter (ChannelIngress — Olas Mech Marketplace, Gnosis)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=grey
WorkingDirectory=/opt/grey/grey
ExecStart=/usr/bin/node adapters/mech-adapter/dist/main.js
EnvironmentFile=/etc/grey/mech-adapter-gnosis.env
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5

# Hardening (drop if a probe shows it breaks node/pg; report before removing) — mirrors the Base
# unit's own hardening exactly.
NoNewPrivileges=true
ProtectSystem=full
PrivateTmp=true

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
